{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/8e203e7f5d2baeedf5936261453ef3b7.poster.avif?t=1755121715\" width=1138 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/8e203e7f5d2baeedf5936261453ef3b7.webm?t=1755121715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you discover?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Office Rooms is a multiple ending liminal space game set in the endless offices of a <strong>completely fictional</strong>\u00a0tech corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just here - no monsters - no jump scares - just you and the white walls. What will you discover in the office rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an office worker in a cryptic corporation with unknown goals and operations. As you explore you discover dark secrets, unsettling truths, and multiple endings from escaping, to deep lore and conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each work day presents new procedurally generated floors of hallways and rooms with <strong>[REDACTED]</strong> rooms dispersed throughout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to keep in touch!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1925940?t=1755121715","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/8408aec983eeee1c89f03839fcd440c4fe893711/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755121715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/571e44322478f6fb445304557b7d04b880adf5fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755121715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati